Advanced Offense enhances a combatant's attacking capabilities beyond the
basics of the Offense skill. Warriors trained in advanced offensive techniques
strike with greater precision and power.

This skill provides passive bonuses when fighting in Offensive combat mode.
Higher learning translates to more frequent successful strikes and increased
damage output. The skill works automatically once learned - no command is
required to activate it.

Advanced Offense pairs well with the basic Offense skill. Together, they
allow aggressive fighters to maximize their damage potential, though at
the cost of defensive capability.

Class: General
Discipline: Offense

